{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0wRCQPYQSBbJcvhgvIa05A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:20.604745+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0wRCQPYQSBbJcvhgvIa05A","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ddeLTkxqyfMDf6b5icYPdrzARAcj7Ffgia3Rg1b6fTyUemy3H0V8yQ9HUOpR8OEcTMZdBx1fBF7xNnRwYeSsZ09Ew44RYy9ngeMHqEzkHaW88/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>南方科技大学力学与航空航天工程系</span></strong><span>（以下简称“力航系”）拟于2026年7月上旬举办全国优秀大学生夏季交流营，旨在增进国内高校优秀本科生对力学和航空航天学科的了解，感受力航系特色教学科研氛围，搭建师生深度交流、互助成长的平台。现诚邀全国优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>1、全国高校本科三年级在校生（2027届本科毕业生），可获得免推资格的本科生优先考虑</span></p><p><span>2、成果突出的优秀往届本科生和应往届硕士生</span></p><p><span>3、成绩优秀，英语水平良好</span></p><p><span>4、科研兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力</span></p><p><span>5、身心健康、诚实守信、学风端正</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动安排</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>1、活动时间：预计2026年7月上旬</span></p><p><span>2、活动安排：拟采用线下交流形式，内容包含不限于开营仪式、院系介绍、分组交流、师生自由交流及实验室参观等。</span></p><p><span>3、活动费用：夏令营暂定以线下方式举行，南科大力航系将为异地学校营员提供夏令营期间在深圳的免费食宿，并给予部分路费补贴。深圳地区高校学生原则上不提供住宿和路费补贴，仅提供免费用餐。</span></p><p><span>*活动安排以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；</span></p><p><span>*营员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式及材料提交</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>1、申请时间：即日起- 6月15日</span></p><p><span>2、报名方式：申请人登录南科大交流营网上报名系统注册登录，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。网址：</span></p><p><span>https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/（建议使用Chrome或360极速浏览器），点击“全国优秀大学生夏季交流营”进行在线报名，必须填报不超过3位意向交流老师，按要求提供本人各项真实信息，并上传相关材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件。</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件（在校生提供）或毕业证书与学位证书复印件（往届生提供）。</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务加盖公章，硕士生需同时提交本科成绩单），成绩单上注明所在专业的成绩排名。</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述PDF,介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内。</span></p><p><span>（5）其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等，扫描为一个PDF后上传系统）。</span></p><p><span>（6）报名申请表（签字版），请先在系统完成报名申请，提交后下载打印报名申请表，按要求签字后提交至系统。</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>我系导师及研究方向见系官网:</span></p><p><span>https://mae.sustech.edu.cn/faculty/index/cid/3.html?lang=zh-cn。</span></p><p><span>点击文末“阅读原文”跳转至系官网。（建议提前与填写的意向交流老师沟通联系）</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>审核选拔</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>申请截止后，交流营评审工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将通过报名系统以及电子邮件形式通知，未通过者不作另外通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动咨询</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>有关交流营活动咨询，请优先以</span><strong><span>“2026交流营咨询”</span></strong><span>为邮件主题发送给：</span></p><p><span>maeyzb@sustech.edu.cn或加入南科大力航系夏令营官方QQ群：768740429（</span><strong><span>备注姓名-学校-专业</span></strong><span>）或在工作时间内致电：0755-88011430 常老师</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>更多信息请关注南方科技大学力学与航空航天工程系官网：</span></p><p><span>https://mae.sustech.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>欢迎扫码加入南科大力航系研招QQ群</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ddeLTkxqyfOF4NDbQqno1r9iaiajTqDbghNWORh0TqMxf02WSDTXD0tkv4rHicuRvhs5icLJt1oUsQO5OvaOckRmDb8tGYz33rRmcaXzicwe1Xpo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>往期风采</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ddeLTkxqyfO29TZErWaxyX54ayDhpFS7Q8pmhIdgASZfDBJeJ90iaXI2ic0dlnhO5niaeJREpTQMXMC7r1L4cEAYzHuzSghRgFtJlutVj68Un0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ddeLTkxqyfOoY8h1TEYAf0SfC8iaUwfW4B3JXgfS5kBNlibbp9y9L3UuFWicG0T8cZKIqT97m1bR1yAlgrB5Szicm2oDM0Ria3yojdnQrWtyZJho/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ddeLTkxqyfOudIldhJ4ScnzmRL3dHsicIWOnJyTsQnYDWhMexdK6iambxTKtJlicGhmicREweGYFxTAzNBz4qo49NeF2DZrQcVBT5ibqODDRlvib4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ddeLTkxqyfNH2TpFNAhf5Fn0xJbMq0E3Ff570wKIAIYNXFuZhgZSEDCDTwSAqu584QnVYWy8J5HsXicTU7X8t5BTXYZM9l5ialBVnobtJ05ac/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ddeLTkxqyfO6CI3Sksm6yE24mofic78K2ZyS0ZeZAsoxNxuiaQXOB3OeYsW4gZ0fv26rcrHE9L3OI4f6AhoAdZRK2icFo2sjYYRB6UFWs2ggsE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ddeLTkxqyfNXb0lz8GqeYz6huL04NkGnicIeyAN9w1S7oR7NkUfuHh4mlBOsf6le1swqzhPkVkHEqFahv8HoPTO5xk7mIIgHGWECUL3plWZs/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>力航系简介</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>南科大力学与航空航天工程系成立于2015年12月，是南科大首批完成本、硕、博三级人才培养体系建设的院系之一。力航系以国家战略和大湾区产业发展为牵引，聚焦国际前沿研究和“卡脖子”技术需求，潜心培养兼具科学素养、工匠精神和国际化视野的创新拔尖人才，致力于成为一流学科发展和一流人才培养的重镇。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>目前，力航系拥有包括</span><strong><span>3</span></strong><span>位院士、</span><strong><span>7</span></strong><span>位国际学会会士、</span><strong><span>18</span></strong><span>位国家级人才在内的</span><strong><span>30</span></strong><span>位全职教师。围绕湍流、多相流、计算力学、软物质力学、航空发动机和新型无人机等方向开展基础研究和应用基础研究。目前已建成</span><strong><span>8</span></strong><span>个省市级重点实验室，承担了</span><strong><span>400余</span></strong><span>项科研项目，项目经费累计超</span><strong><span>6亿</span></strong><span>元；发表学术论文</span><strong><span>1780余</span></strong><span>篇。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>力航系秉承“以学生发展成效为核心\"的教育理念，在探索“新工科”的教改实践中逐渐形成了“厚基础，重创新，强交叉，国际化”的人才培养特色，并取得了显著成效：建系10年中有</span><strong><span>10名</span></strong><span>毕业生荣获“南方科技大学十佳毕业生”的称号，多名毕业生前往麻省理工学院、普林斯顿大学、耶鲁大学等世界顶尖大学深造；博士毕业生及出站博士后获得中国科学技术大学、中山大学、北京航空航天大学等知名学府的教职。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ddeLTkxqyfMKU3BPCOMick88a0mbWKCwHdZoPP36WGgyJgcTico9jz4FLwX57HQ8H04nj1dtHQPick6d5N0bkYtrpTzwMH0heHmIic95rbhfWNw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><em><span>欢迎广大优秀学生报名！</span></em></strong></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/ahYgKq35SuN98h6iaTocth4VwBepOhQTfoichzXaWQHMOpkic4l4NeEAxakPmMRicUgZboJBf47hXpUdrvGmbv6Z6g/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8947324d6fd3843d7508f276fecc8a71a8422d759048375408ac9697bd491ff4","textLength":1791,"sourceSha256":"26c281aca55458452ba7ebf4522d9939188b0924371b713a61021e870c5deebe","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a195de4cf52c7cce95d9","title":"2026年南方科技大学力学与航空航天工程系2026年全国优秀大学生夏季交流营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:20.604745+00:00"}
